other. He is the student council president. He often skips his student council president's duties. Every time he does he gets in a quarrel with the vice president, Kyouka, and Shinichi has to calm the two of them down. He is overprotective of Misaki and is always worried about her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c8611"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e5/e54f91083ac884516dcbaf8cfd2abb9795b7a825cb63cfea17c28923db7224fd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/55/55e3d90fff8a96535088c7b6f46d463b34a873f3b768ddc004bbd2dc8ba31194.webp","width":207,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"角川 竜二","creatorId":"vndb:s1896","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1896","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1896","name":"丸山 竜一","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:28041","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c8612","characterName":"栄原 鏡香","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c8612"},"originalCharacterName":"栄原 鏡香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A third year student and vice president of the student council. She is a straightforward, too serious, inflexible person that constantly opposes Itsuki. She is an enthusiastic Christian and takes Itsuki along to church to participate in events."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c8612"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9f/9f42eaaf9bb174b20e0edf19d4ce07673a3fd837930e8700cf86e430981a9e51.webp","fallbac